Description: MIDI: learn the Auto DJ request button from the skin
 [AutoDJ],request_learn (toggle): the next button pressed on any MIDI
 controller becomes the Auto DJ request button ([Library],AutoDjAddRequest);
 [AutoDJ],request_learn_clear forgets it; [AutoDJ],request_learned shows
 whether one is set. Stored in "[Auto DJ],RequestButton" as
 "<status> <data1> <controller name>", not in the controller's mapping, so the
 mapping file stays untouched and its updates still apply. The learned
 button's messages only push the request control (the mapping does not see
 them). Lets a skin without menu bar offer a LEARN button; DecksmithOS only.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
